The task is to create a FastAPI-based API that allows users to upload multiple PDF files and receive a single concatenated PDF file in response. The API must adhere to a specified OpenAPI schema and utilize the `pdfunite` command-line tool for the concatenation process.

### Summary of the Plan
The implementation plan involves setting up a FastAPI application with a POST endpoint `/concatenate` that accepts multiple PDF files via multipart/form-data. The uploaded files will be validated to ensure they are PDFs, temporarily saved on the server, concatenated using `pdfunite`, and the resulting PDF will be returned to the user. Error handling will be implemented for invalid inputs and server errors.

### Summary of Security Guidelines
